<section class="booking-track-section public-track-page"><div class="booking-track-copy"><a class="back-link" href="<?= site_url() ?>">← Beranda</a><span class="eyebrow">LACAK STATUS</span><h1>Lacak permohonan</h1><p>Masukkan enam karakter kode booking pada bukti order. Hasil SKHP dapat diunduh tanpa masuk setelah seluruh proses selesai.</p></div><div class="booking-track-card">
